s=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993110/extras/43eb0c9421f18f5d5f09f5d1dceb5f0f.poster.avif?t=1663867178\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993110/extras/43eb0c9421f18f5d5f09f5d1dceb5f0f.webm?t=1663867178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993110/extras/43eb0c9421f18f5d5f09f5d1dceb5f0f.mp4?t=1663867178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
